      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:138d18864fc8fd38882c0600",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我陪着因为学生成长感动不已的她，\n一起守候中山庆典的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b3985f866d87159e3d55bce377135fc443d9dbf3cfa9e07c6e21f84c9ff4f60",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6b6ef941eb022d8e836e9f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同时思考着接下来的方向──\n出道战结束后，我与中山庆典\n该走哪条路线前进世界？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f9b7720554574a54a586101f5949fc6a270a9a873480325603d3fc88e6dacad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049200.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18d2eff30f4a1e678648f348",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那时我正为了中山庆典，\n传送预定参赛的赛马娘资讯\n到她的手机里──",
      "source_fingerprint": "02afca69ae4ffc4d06c5ea6078c5e514c38c49cb7d23cde9081105108ab31fd2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
