      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "记得那个歌手的女儿是今天参赛？\n一定要拍到她──呃……",
      "source_fingerprint": "48a304864bcdbbd1c1c793378f4448647d1a482273683f3c758e14366544c6a1",
