    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f365f2149c50b4d41a7999e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "光有一定的实力还不够。\n既然敢当众宣布挑战“凯旋门赏”，\n这种小比赛一定能轻松获胜才是～",
      "source_fingerprint": "129f875bc799ff49f9bea69fe81991e22e1dd5fe2f579866e174a0c5c78575b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1049/storytimeline_501049201.json",
      "json_path": [
